
### Create a test account once
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{loginEmail}}",
  "password": "{{password}}",
  "preferredLanguage": "en"
}

### @name login
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{loginEmail}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### Current profile
GET {{host}}/api/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Built-in foods
GET {{host}}/api/foods
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Symptom types
GET {{host}}/api/symptom-types
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Today's timeline
GET {{host}}/api/timeline?date={{today}}&offsetMinutes=0
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Today's daily context
GET {{host}}/api/daily/{{today}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Severity trend
GET {{host}}/api/insights/severity-trend?days=30&offsetMinutes=0
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Food correlation
GET {{host}}/api/insights/food-correlation?windowHours=6&offsetMinutes=0
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Seven-day English report
GET {{host}}/api/reports/pdf?from={{today}}&to={{today}}&lang=en&offsetMinutes=0
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
